OL,3,GNEWSAMen arrested after woman, 22, dies
OL,4,Ain A1(M) crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof causing the death of a 22-year-old
OL,8,Fwoman in a crash on the A1(M) in North
OL,9,FYorkshire.
OL,11,FA silver Ford Transit van and a silver
OL,12,FVolkswagen Golf car collided at
OL,13,Fapproximately 18:10 BST on Sunday. Both
OL,14,Fvehicles were travelling southbound in
OL,15,Fthe Barton area, north of Scotch
OL,16,FCorner, according to North Yorkshire
OL,17,FPolice.
OL,19,FThe woman, from Newcastle, was
OL,20,Fpronounced dead at the scene, a force
OL,21,Fspokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
